    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF150 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCErrorEvent\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCErrorEvent</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCError\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCError</code></a>, <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCPeerConnectionIceErrorEvent</code>](<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCPeerConnectionIceErrorEvent\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCPeerConnectionIceErrorEvent</a>), <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCPeerConnection/icecandidateerror_event\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCPeerConnection.icecandidateerror</code> event</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCIceTransport/role\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCIceTransport.role</code></a>. This adds three separate release notes (corresponding to the bugzilla issues).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4357410680\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43970\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43970/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43970\">#43970</a></p>",
