        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Updated the introduction for <code class=\"notranslate\">position-anchor</code> property</li>\n<li>Updated syntax for <code class=\"notranslate\">position-anchor</code> property</li>\n<li>Updated values for <code class=\"notranslate\">position-anchor</code> property</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Working on <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43867\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43867/hovercard\">MDN issues #43867</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1068\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1068/hovercard\">Data PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44016\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44016/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44017",
            "title": "added normal & match-parent values and updated intro",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-11T14:31:06.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-05T15:43:16.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Documents the difference between the <code class=\"notranslate\">:</code> (plain) and <code class=\"notranslate\">=</code> (range) forms of <code class=\"notranslate\">style()</code> in container style queries:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds a new section to the container size and style queries guide.</li>\n<li>Adds a summary in the <code class=\"notranslate\">@container</code> reference linking to the guide.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To clear the difference between <code class=\"notranslate\">style(--n: 3)</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">style(--n = 3)</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Spec: <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-conditional-5/#style-container-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS Conditional 5 §6.2 Style Container Features</a>.</li>\n<li>Inspired by <a href=\"https://css-tip.com/if-trick/\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Hidden Trick of Style Queries and <code class=\"notranslate\">if()</code></a> by Temani Afif.</li>\n<li>Related Firefox DevTools work: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2032963\" rel=\"nofollow\">bug 2032963</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44014",
            "title": "Add plain vs range syntax section to container queries guide",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-10T23:39:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-05T14:00:39.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "pepelsbey",
                "url": "https://github.com/pepelsbey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As per <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4358242192\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43974\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43974/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43974\">#43974</a>, there are some features required for the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/Test_your_skills/Forms_and_buttons\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTML forms assessment</a> solutions that are not covered in the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/HTML_forms\" rel=\"nofollow\">related tutorial</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've decided to fix this by making sure the required features are all referenced in the tutorial.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43974.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4358242192\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43974\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43974/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43974\">#43974</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44013",
            "title": "Reference HTML forms assessment features not covered in the tutorial",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-05T12:53:51.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-05T12:51:50.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204911984?u=46a40d1543289249e3adde977ec40bf317868dd9&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clarifies that specificity is a value (weight) computed by the specificity algorithm and used in the cascade, removing wording that implied specificity itself is an algorithm.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The current phrasing is conceptually inconsistent and can confuse readers. This makes the explanation more precise and aligns with how the cascade uses specificity values.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44000.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4376632289\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44000\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44000/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44000\">#44000</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44009",
            "title": "Clarify specificity as value",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-11T13:50:12.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-05T01:15:05.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caiolucasbittencourt",
                "url": "https://github.com/caiolucasbittencourt"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The structure of the guide to native manifests made it difficult to reference location information for a specific manifest. This change moves the location information into sections immediately after each manifest description. This enables linking to location details and makes it easier for the reader to find location information for a manifest.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #22534.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1464268570\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/22534\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/22534/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/22534\">#22534</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44008",
            "title": "Issue-22534 native manifest reference improvement",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-04T23:59:08.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-04T23:57:20.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added syntax for <em>range syntax</em> for <code class=\"notranslate\">@container style()</code> queries</li>\n<li>Added example for <em>range syntax</em> for <code class=\"notranslate\">@container style()</code> queries</li>\n<li>Added see also link for CSSContainerRule</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Working on <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43862\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43862/hovercard\">MDN Issue #43862</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29599\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29599/hovercard\">BCD PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44002\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44002/hovercard\">FF Relase PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
